  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.1: Backtick-aware interpolation diagnostics and code fixes\n- Own the usage-analyzer and code-fix assemblies in one package, installed automatically through the JRK.JevRunner dependency.\n- JEV100 detects lost automatic quoting in plain strings; its fix wraps the interpolation in Escape.Interpolated.\n- JEV101 detects redundant explicit backticks in preserved interpolations; its fix removes only the adjacent pair.\n- Recognize generic constraint chains and marker interfaces inherited through class constraints.\n- Simplify generated helper qualification where safe while preserving correct binding when local names conflict.",
